WEBVTT

00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:16,480
Hello, Dr. Cutters. I suffer from chronic Lyme and I have for many years in the last month

00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:25,360
added the significant breast pain to my other symptoms. I ask what this is about, but it's the

00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:34,400
cause. Thanks a lot for your answer. So breast pain in itself would it be necessarily a common

00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:43,920
issue from Lyme disease. So then you've got to go why do you have breast pain? So you've got to

00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:50,320
remember sometimes when we have an issue like even like cancer. So let's say you have breast cancer

00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:55,040
and now you're having pain in your gut because that media metastasis to the gut. Do you mean that

00:00:55,040 --> 00:01:04,000
gut pain is tied to the cancer? And it certainly is a question that we need to ask, but it's

00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:11,920
common that when we have a serious already diagnosed condition like chronic Lyme that we

00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:19,440
want to attribute other morbidities to that disease and it's not always fair. Now of course

00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:26,240
everything is tied together at your body. So if you have chronic Lyme and inflammation from that

00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:31,360
chronic Lyme could that inflammation be affecting the breast? Why certainly it could. But if this is

00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:37,200
something new that you've had like this, I don't know who asked this question, but it sounds like

00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:44,080
whoever asked this question has had chronic Lyme for some time. And now as a new symptom of breast

00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:53,280
pain, I would investigate that. Now usually I would say usually we'll underline that word. If a person

00:01:53,360 --> 00:02:04,880
has breast pain, that's a side of inflammation or some sort of inflammatory process going on

00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:14,560
at that spot where the pain is. Usually cancers don't cause pain, but inflammatory breast disease

00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:21,600
and inflammatory breast cancer can. So I would certainly get that checked out. If you're not inclined

00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:28,400
to do a mammogram, I would definitely do a thermography to get that that spot checked out and see

00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:36,000
what's going on. If you're palpated, you don't palpate any lumps or anything, but there's a specific

00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:42,320
spot of pain. I don't know. This is all the question that was asked. I'd be asking the question if we

00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:47,680
were communicating one on one, is the breast pain in a certain spot? Can you point to that spot? Or is

00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:54,320
it in both breasts? Equally, is it cover the entire breast or both breasts? The more

00:02:56,400 --> 00:03:03,200
diffuse the pain would be the more I would think that it's due to just general inflammation.

00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:11,280
Some tests that you could do, I already mentioned a mammogram or a thermography. Other tests for systemic

00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:21,920
inflammation would be to do a complete metabolic panel and a CBC yet just some blood work done to see

00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:34,540
if there's, make sure you're including C-reactive protein and some inflammatory markers in that panel

00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:41,020
so you can see if there's a source of inflammation. If it's been going on a few months,

00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:49,820
could it be an infection? Yes, a chronic infection can last months or years. Typically,

00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:55,340
that will show up on a CBC. You'll see it elevated by blood cell count. So those are some things that

00:03:55,340 --> 00:04:02,460
you want to investigate. So like anything, when you have symptoms, symptoms are a sign of something

00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:07,580
going on. So you always want to ask, what is this a sign up? What is my body trying to tell me?

00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:16,540
How do I dig to get to the root cause of this? That's how you want to correct it. So you always want

00:04:16,540 --> 00:04:22,700
to look at, okay, what is this? Is this caused by my Lyme disease? Is this caused something else?

00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:35,500
You want to figure that out in order to treat it properly and to give your best chance to have you healing?

